<BaseLayout title="WINKS Cinema · Massage video & TV ad" description="Step into WINKS Cinema for the WINKS Massage Video and WINKS TV Ad Video.">
  <section class="page-hero"><span class="page-hero__watermark">CINEMA</span><div class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-4 page-hero__content"><div class="breadcrumb-line"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span class="current">Cinema</span></div><span class="eyebrow mt-4">WINKS Cinema</span><h1>A glimpse of<br /><em>the atmosphere.</em></h1><p>Film, mood and movement — a little more of the WINKS world before you arrive.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section--line"><div class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-4"><div class="collection-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">Watch the world of WINKS</span><h2 class="section-title">Press<br /><em>play.</em></h2></div><p class="lead-copy">The video slots below are ready for your final WINKS footage. Add the MP4 files in <code>/public/videos</code> and the autoplay, muted, loop behaviour is already wired into the page.</p></div><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-lg-7"><a class="video-frame d-block" href="/cinema/massage-video"><div class="video-placeholder-badge">Autoplay preview · muted</div><video class="cinema-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="/images/winks-cinema.jpg" aria-label="WINKS massage video preview"><source src="/videos/winks-massage-video.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video><div class="video-frame__overlay"><span class="eyebrow">WINKS MASSAGE VIDEO</span><h2>The ritual<br />in motion.</h2><span class="text-link">Open film page <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div></a></div><div class="col-lg-5"><a class="video-frame d-block" href="/cinema/tv-ad"><div class="video-placeholder-badge">Autoplay preview · muted</div><video class="cinema-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="/images/winks-hero.jpg" aria-label="WINKS TV advertisement preview"><source src="/videos/winks-tv-ad.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video><div class="video-frame__overlay"><span class="eyebrow">WINKS TV AD VIDEO</span><h2>A little<br /><em>WINKS.</em></h2><span class="text-link">Open ad page <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div></a></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section--white section--tight"><div class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-4"><div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-end gap-3"><div><span class="eyebrow">A private frame of mind</span><h2 class="section-title mb-0">See the mood<br /><em>before the moment.</em></h2></div><a class="btn btn-outline-gold" href="/contact/reserve">Reserve an experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
